# ============================================================
# ZyraxonOS — the glass desktop environment
# Hyprland (Wayland compositor) + quickshell (QML shell).
# The desktop is the ZyraxonOS glass shell, deployed by the branding hook
# from config/dots. Hyprland and quickshell come from
# trixie-backports; everything else is from trixie.
# ============================================================

